{"uid":"4d20b757af63fe35","name":"test_a_rejecting_verdict_after_the_deadline_holds_the_run","fullName":"tests.test_deadline#test_a_rejecting_verdict_after_the_deadline_holds_the_run","historyId":"9e2dd10ab62355f2093a5f16f91539a4","time":{"start":1791921636538,"stop":1791921636590,"duration":52},"description":"Same fixture shape as Section I's own passing-verdict sibling\n    (`test_a_passing_verdict_after_the_deadline_concludes_the_run_normally`):\n    `iterations_used=1` plus a pre-seeded task skip planning straight to\n    `worker`; the worker completes the sole task while the deadline is\n    still ordinarily in the future, so review is dispatched normally; the\n    deadline is then pushed into the past from INSIDE the running review\n    iteration itself. This time review renders a REJECTING verdict over\n    one blocking, curable finding -- the run must hold `exhausted` with a\n    null verdict, and the rejection's findings and the cure task it opened\n    must both still be on disk, with the ordinary cure-pass counter exactly\n    as it would read for an in-budget rejection.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Same fixture shape as Section I's own passing-verdict sibling<br />\n(<code>test_a_passing_verdict_after_the_deadline_concludes_the_run_normally</code>):<br />\n<code>iterations_used=1</code> plus a pre-seeded task skip planning straight to<br />\n<code>worker</code>; the worker completes the sole task while the deadline is<br />\nstill ordinarily in the future, so review is dispatched normally; the<br />\ndeadline is then pushed into the past from INSIDE the running review<br />\niteration itself. This time review renders a REJECTING verdict over<br />\none blocking, curable finding -- the run must hold <code>exhausted</code> with a<br />\nnull verdict, and the rejection's findings and the cure task it opened<br />\nmust both still be on disk, with the ordinary cure-pass counter exactly<br />\nas it would read for an in-budget rejection.</p>\n","status":"pass